  "description": "An easy to use, simple yet feature-rich open-source framework for writing middlewares in the form of low resource footnote Windows services, Linux Daemons or containerized microservices.\n      Takes care of multi-threaded service granular scheduling, shutdowns, restarts, error recovery.",
